meta {
  name: saveCustomClass
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: https://{{customer}}.{{domain}}/jsonrpc
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveCustomClass",
    "params": {
      "custom_class_code": "LOGISTICS",
      "custom_class_name": "Logistics"
    },
    "id": 1
  }
}

docs {
  Create or update a custom classification class

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |---|---|---|---|
  | `custom_class_id` | integer (nullable) | no | Internal ID of the custom class; omit to create a new class |
  | `custom_class_code` | string (nullable) | no | Unique code identifying the custom class |
  | `custom_class_name` | string (nullable) | no | Display name of the custom class |
  | `is_deprecated` | boolean (nullable) | no | Mark this class as deprecated to hide it from new classifications |
  | `_features` | object[] (nullable) | no | Feature assignments for this class |

  **Example: Create a custom class**. Use _features to associate features with the class on creation or update.

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveCustomClass",
    "params": {
      "custom_class_code": "LOGISTICS",
      "custom_class_name": "Logistics"
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "custom_class_id": 1
  }
  ```

  **Example: Create a class with features and enum values**

  ```json
  {
    "jsonrpc": "2.0",
    "method": "saveCustomClass",
    "params": {
      "custom_class_code": "COLOUR",
      "custom_class_name": "Colour",
      "_features": [
        {
          "custom_feature_id": 5,
          "order_number": 1,
          "_values": [
            {
              "custom_value_id": 10,
              "order_number": 1
            },
            {
              "custom_value_id": 11,
              "order_number": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "id": 1
  }
  ```

  Result:

  ```json
  {
    "custom_class_id": 2
  }
  ```
}
